the target language is: prolog.

the knowledge base manifests includes these resources:
    lomo.

the knowledge base manifests includes:

the text of the source description is at "sources/manifests.ttl".

% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


dataset interoperability report 2025 is identified by "http://example.org/Dataset_InteroperabilityReport2025".

dataset interoperability report 2025 is a dataset.

dataset interoperability report 2025 has the title "Interoperability Report 2025 Dataset".

dataset interoperability report 2025 manifests result annual report 2025 interoperability.


result annual report 2025 interoperability is identified by "http://example.org/Result_AnnualReport2025_Interoperability".

result annual report 2025 interoperability is an action result.

result annual report 2025 interoperability has the label "Annual Report 2025 on Interoperability".


dataset interoperability reports is identified by "http://example.org/Dataset_InteroperabilityReports".

dataset interoperability reports is a dataset.

dataset interoperability reports has the title "Interoperability Reports Dataset".

dataset interoperability reports manifests result type annual interoperability report.


result type annual interoperability report is identified by "http://example.org/ResultType_AnnualInteroperabilityReport".

result type annual interoperability report is an action result type.

result type annual interoperability report has the label "Annual Report on Interoperability".


% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

query datasets is:
    which thing is a dataset.

query parts is:
    which thing is part of the description.

query texts is:
    which thing is described by the text which text.

query addresses is:
    which thing is identified by which address.

query bearer is:
    the bearer role is which role.

